Scenario:

A customer purchases several items, including repeated items. Write a Java program using LinkedHashSet to display only unique items in the order they were purchased.

Program:

import java.util.LinkedHashSet;

public class UniqueItems {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        LinkedHashSet<String> items = new LinkedHashSet<>();

        items.add("Laptop");
        items.add("Phone");
        items.add("Headphones");
        items.add("Phone");
        items.add("Mouse");
        items.add("Laptop");

        System.out.println("Unique Purchased Items:");

        for (String item : items) {
            System.out.println(item);
        }
    }
}

Output:

Unique Purchased Items:
Laptop
Phone
Headphones
Mouse
